<title>HONG KONG: Taishin Int'l Bank sets US$60 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Taishin Int'l Bank sets US$60 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger and bookrunner Citicorp International.</p>
<p> BORROWER    TAISHIN INTERNATIONAL BANK, OFFSHORE BANKING BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT	US$60 MLN   COUPON     3ML+20BP MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	  FRCD	  ISS PRICE  PAR	LAUNCHED  24.JUN.97</p>
<p> PUTS	  YR 3	  CALLS	YR 3     REPLIES   18.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING     --	    REPAYMENT  BULLET   DENOMS    $500K</p>
<p> RATING	NONE	  SALE LMTS  STANDARD TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG     --	    CRS DEF    YES	FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY   TAIWAN	GOV LAW    ENGLISH  PAY DATE  --</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>PUT WAIVER FEE OF 8.0 BP</p>
<p>   CO-ARRANGERS     US$10 MLN+   20.5BP   ALL-IN  26.83</p>
<p>   LEAD MANAGERS    US$6-10 MLN  18.0BP   ALL-IN  26.00</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	   US$4-6 MLN   16.0BP   ALL-IN  25.33</p>
<p>   CO-MANAGERS	US$2-4 MLN   14.0BP   ALL-IN  24.66</p>
<p> ARRANGERS   WESTLB ASIA PACIFIC (AGENT) AND CITICORP</p>
<p>		 INTERNATIONAL (BOOKS)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
